ME"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_UP_TO_10_MIN"],"最多 10 分鐘",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjcy6iz9tmWAxVlSfUHHTn8J7QQ3YcHCHAoAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwjcy6iz9tmWAxVlSfUHHTn8J7QQ3IcHCG8oEw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["已經有近2000評論，評價4.3的店，應該是相當有實力吧?帶著這樣的心情來吃晚餐。\n周五的晚上都快8點半了，客人還是近9成，裝潢簡約明亮，雖然也有炸物類的餐點，但沒有聞到什麼異味。掃碼點餐＞結帳。服務人員問我們需要飲料嗎？我們第一次來，不知道有免費的飲料，因此點了可樂，之後才發現是有免費自取飲料的。\n出餐速度很快，所點的餐點相當可口，有一定的水準。\n下面將餐點略述一下：\n1.蒜味豚骨拉麵。湯頭很醇厚，蒜味帶勁，感覺是最強的部分，如果覺得不够辣有辣油與七味粉可以加；麵的部份感覺一般，麵芯稍微有留著韌性，算是標準的熟度，如果能提供客製化就更好了！這裡的叉燒比一般的大，叉燒不像一般日式拉麵燉煮得那麼軟爛那麼入口即化，是還帶著些豬肉的韌性與嚼勁的。\n2.炸雞軟骨：不油膩，特色是帶著些肉的雞軟骨，肉很香，軟骨就稍微炸得不夠酥脆。\n3.炸蝦：蝦子不大，鮮甜，跟一般天婦羅不同，外表麵衣顆粒比較大，有點像米香，完全不油膩！\n4.醬燒魷魚-調味還不錯，魷魚很有嚼勁，牙口不好的可以嚼很久，這道菜還不錯，可能是預製菜，不知是否原來就設定是涼菜，不太熱。",null,[0,150]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4113828771456188976/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDZEZKc1NrZE9la1p1VTJ4YWNGUXlkRVJTVm04d1RWaG9iMlF6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4113828771456188976/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDZEZKc1NrZE9la1p1VTJ4YWNGUXlkRVJTVm04d1RWaG9iMlF6WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/4113828771456188976/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDZEZKc1NrZE9la1p1VTJ4YWNGUXlkRVJTVm04d1RWaG9iMlF6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4113828771456188976/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDZEZKc1NrZE9la1p1VTJ4YWNGUXlkRVJTVm04d1RWaG9iMlF6WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4113828771456188976/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDZEZKc1NrZE9la1p1VTJ4YWNGUXlkRVJTVm04d1RWaG9iMlF6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4113828771456188976/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDZEZKc1NrZE9la1p1VTJ4YWNGUXlkRVJTVm04d1RWaG9iMlF6WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,3561,["https://www.google.com/maps/rev